---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Projects — Fabio Steyer"
  description="Publicly verifiable projects with repository, runnable demo and tests."
  altHref="/projekte"
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Projects</h1>

  <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
    This page carries only what can be checked: source code, a runnable demo, tests, and
    instructions that get the project started in a few minutes.
  </p>

  <div class="beleg-fehlt mt-8">
    <strong>EVIDENCE MISSING.</strong> The first public demonstration project has not been built
    yet. Until then this page stays empty. No project is described here before its repository
    is public.
  </div>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="planned">
    <h2 id="planned" class="doc-section__label">What will go here</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        A clean-room project: built from scratch, synthetic sample data only, nothing carried over
        from previous employment. It demonstrates a class of problem I have worked on without
        exposing any company data.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-muted)">
        Every entry will state what the project shows — and what it does not.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
